          "freetext": {
            "notes": [
              {
                "label": "Description",
                "content": "This folder contains a sheet entitled “Directions for Miles Dominance Test.” The test measures dominance but does so by telling the test taker they are taking a test of “sharpness and quickness in seeing.” The sheet lists four steps for proctoring the test."
